{"t":"Grimvale","s":"grimvale-afd4f","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Werebear_7ad13b.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Grimvale</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Werebear\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Werebear_7ad13b.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">North-east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Stonehome\">Stonehome</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33333,31690,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33333, 31690, 7)</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">All vocations.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Level &amp; Skills' Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvlknights\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"> <div class=\"skills-box\"> <h3 class=\"skills-box-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General\">General</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">100</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\"></span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\"></span> </div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.80<br/>July 21, 2015<br/>Summer Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Grimvale</b> is a small island located north-east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Stonehome\">Stonehome</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>. It can be reached by taking the Small Boat with <a href=\"#/wiki/Cornell\">Cornell</a>, located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33304,31720,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33304, 31720, 7)</a>.\n</p><p>According to Lionet: \n</p>\n<blockquote><p>\"the moon will be full around the 12th-14th each month (the 13th of each month being the prime time for the events on Grimvale). We introduced these \"moon phases\" to be a constant phenomenon around the 13th of each month during the whole year.\" (source)\n</p></blockquote>\n<p>This means depending on the time of the month you are visiting Grimvale, you either encounter fairly harmless creatures such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Badger\">Badgers</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Bandit\">Bandits</a>, or a lot stronger creatures such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Werebadger\">Werebadgers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Werebear\">Werebear</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Wereboar\">Wereboars</a>. Also, you will either encounter <a href=\"#/wiki/Purple%20Nightshade\">Purple Nightshade</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Blooming%20Purple%20Nightshade\">Blooming Purple Nightshade</a>.\n</p><p>The <a href=\"#/quest/grimvale-quest\">Grimvale Quest</a> takes place here. Grimvale is also one of the spots you have to cartograph during the <a href=\"#/quest/cartography-101-quest\">Cartography 101 Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Grimvale NPCs (4 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cornell\">Cornell</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cornell\"><img alt=\"Cornell\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cornell_b079f4.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Ferryman</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">North of <a href=\"#/wiki/Stonehome\">Stonehome</a> and south on <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Grimvale</strong>, approximately <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33341,31694,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33341, 31694, 7)</a>.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gladys\">Gladys</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gladys\"><img alt=\"Gladys\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gladys_a5ceee.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Druid</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\">Southeast on <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Grimvale</strong>, in her little house.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Maeryn\">Maeryn</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Maeryn\"><img alt=\"Maeryn\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Maeryn_01f5c0.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Guard</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">South-west on <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Grimvale</strong>, in a small house.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Owin\">Owin</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Owin\"><img alt=\"Owin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Owin_3cf148.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Hunter</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">On <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Grimvale</strong>, northernmost hut.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Surface:_Not_Moon_